<title>PHILIPPINES: Marcopper to spin off mining operations.</title>
<headline>Marcopper to spin off mining operations.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcopper Mining Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors approved the spin-off of its mining operations into a new, wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>In an advisory to the stock exchange, the board agreed to setting up Newco to take over the mining operations.</p>
</text>
